Package: fdk-dev
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: FemBoyGamerTechGuy <242450780+FemBoyGamerTechGuy@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Version: @PKGVER@
Depends: libfdk1 (= @PKGVER@)
Recommends: pkg-config
Homepage: https://github.com/FemBoyGamerTechGuy/FDK
Description: Faded Dream ToolKit — development files
 Headers, the pkg-config metadata, the unversioned development
 symlink, and the fdk-theme / fdk-set / fdk-prefs command-line tools
 for developing applications against FDK (libfdk1).
 .
 Note: the static archive (libfdk.a) is deliberately NOT shipped.
 Distributing an application with the FDK runtime statically linked
 or bundled requires separate written authorization under the FDK
 Proprietary License, Section 4(d); build from source if you need
 the static archive for local development.
